   "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
   "text": "67 x 67 = 4489 = 8 x 561 + 1, so 67^2 = 1 mod 561,\nyet 67 is neither 1 nor 560 (= -1): a square root\nof 1 that cannot exist modulo a prime",
